 "notes": "Geophysical report (Schlumberger VES soundings). The resistivity-depth layer tables (Tables 1-2, pages 7-9) are not recorded: the schema has no resistivity field and the layers are not stratigraphic units. Recorded only the depths the text interprets geologically (coreholes CCC1-3 basalt at about 750 m; VES 1 of 1975 electric basement; CSC76-VES2 basalt?/crystalline basement?). Figures (pages 10-31) are plotted curves with garbled text; the plate (page 32) shows only sounding locations, no coordinates in text.",
